on checkClock
  [  0] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  3] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  5] getglobal 98 ............................ <nextClockChange>
  [  8] gteq .................................... <the timer >= nextClockChange>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 38] ............................ if the timer >= nextClockChange then
  [ 12] getglobal 11 ............................ <clockTime>
  [ 14] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 17] sub ..................................... <clockTime - 1>
  [ 18] setglobal 11 ............................ clockTime = clockTime - 1
  [ 20] getglobal 11 ............................ <clockTime>
  [ 22] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <clockTime>
  [ 24] localcall 1 ............................. fixClock(clockTime)
  [ 26] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [ 29] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 31] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 34] add ..................................... <the timer + 60>
  [ 35] setglobal 98 ............................ nextClockChange = the timer + 60
  [ 38] ret
end

